# Maintainer: Yūrei Linux project
# Yūrei's own recipe (stage 3, the desktop; docs/INDEPENDENT.md). The source
# address and sum are the ones in independent/bootstrap/sources.lock;
# check-recipes.py keeps them the same.
pkgname=python-mako
_name=mako
_lockname=mako
pkgver=1.3.10
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc="Python templates (Mesa generates code with them)"
arch=(any)
url="https://www.makotemplates.org/"
license=(MIT)
depends=(python)
source=("https://files.pythonhosted.org/packages/source/m/mako/mako-$pkgver.tar.gz")
sha256sums=('99579a6f39583fa7e5630a28c3c1f440e4e97a414b80372649c0ce338da2ea28')

package() {
    pip3 install --no-index --no-build-isolation --no-deps --ignore-installed \
        --root="$pkgdir" --prefix=/usr "$srcdir/$_name-$pkgver"
}
